abbrev PaleXFe (g:Flavor)(F:FrameK (Fin (θ u)) →FrameK (Fin (θ u)))(C:ℝ):Prop:= 0≤C∧∀ i,LiPaJ B0 R u (F i)=SpinFe (chipUFe g) (LiPaJ B0 R u i) ∧ LoomK (F i) ≤ LoomK i*C
