abbrev FlaminaFe {s:ℕ} (F:FrameK (Fin (θ u))→ FrameK (Fin (θ u)))(r:ℕ):P.Test:= if e:s≤r then PaletteEJ B0 x R u D r (F (wΔFe u T v L0 e))-(εΔFe u T v L0 e) • 1 else 0
-- s implicit arg inference in if? tune.
abbrev FuelPanFe (F:FrameK (Fin (θ u))→ FrameK (Fin (θ u)))(s':f0 ≤ s)(d:s ≤ l): ScreensJ P:= let z:= F (wΔFe u T v L0 d); let U:= T.sun L0 l; MeshΦ p B0 M x R u pu A T D V (s'.trans d) (BrJ u U.1 z)+(U.2 z-εΔFe u T v L0 d) • CandΛJ P
abbrev PanEraFe (F:FrameK (Fin (θ u))→FrameK (Fin (θ u)))(s0:f0 ≤ s)(l:ℕ): ScreensJ P:= if e:s≤ l then FuelPanFe p B0 M x R u pu A T D V v L0 F s0 e else 0
